      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The whole process with Green Star Solar (Gavin & the boys) was a fantastic experience.  Gavin was on time to quote on the job as was the team for the system fitment.  They removed our old system without complaint & there was plenty to be upset by as there was a heap of pigeons nesting under our old panels.  The team who removed our old system & fitted up the new system went above and  beyond with their quality of work & service.  They also fitted a PVC coated stainless mesh pigeon guard around the perimeter of our panels which looks and works amazingly as we have completely stopped the pigeons/sky rats from our entering our new system and but eradicated them from our roof without any further deterrents (sonic etc.).Gavin & his team were extremely flexible with us as they gave us time to replace all of the roofing screw/zips (seaside location) and pressure clean the Colourbond roof prior to the new system being fitted.  This took some time due the weather and such but Gavin was happy to accommodate. :)",
